-- ISO-46001-03 · planning_process_documented — Planungsprozess dokumentiert
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall implement and document its water efficiency planning process(es). — printed p.11', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.2, printed p.11) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='a40e529b-c289-42b6-87ac-f9124d588880' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-03 · water_efficiency_management_plan — Wassereffizienz-Managementplan
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='A water efficiency management plan is a document detailing the following: a) identification of locations/areas of an organization’s current water use; b) identification of water recycling potential in the organization’s processes and measurement of quantity and quality of water before and after for those processes that have been identified as having water recycling/recovery potential; c) identification of water-saving measures that can be readily applied, with links to the respective management systems and processes; d) an action plan to implement the identified measures, including identified savings, programme priority and implementation timelines. | 3.34 water efficiency management plan document specifying the means of identifying the potential scope, measures, actions and priorities for achieving efficiencies in the organization’s current water use (3.39) (including any water consumed) — printed p.12, 7', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.2 a)-d); 3.34, printed p.12, 7) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='b55049de-d89d-4d61-998d-c7965951e92c' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-03 · legal_other_requirements — Rechtliche/andere Anforderungen
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall ensure that legal requirements or other requirements are considered in establishing, implementing and maintaining the water efficiency management system and are reviewed at defined intervals. | 3.14 legal requirement or other requirement compliance obligation requirement (3.26) that an organisation (3.20) has to or chooses to comply with — printed p.12, 4', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.3; 3.14, printed p.12, 4) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='05bb7d9b-aa0a-48ef-bd70-e722d32c0dc1' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');

-- ---------------- ISO-46001-04 — Wassernutzungsanalyse & Effizienzindikatoren ----------------
-- ISO-46001-04 · water_use_review — Wassernutzungsanalyse
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall develop, conduct and maintain a water use review to: a) identify the activities and functions that use water; b) record the water used for each identified activity and function; c) determine processes and services that affect the used water quality, with the aim of segregating the used water streams with the objective of water recycling; d) determine activities and functions with the potential for greater water efficiency. | 3.40 water use review determination of the organization’s (3.20) water efficiency performance (3.37) based on data and other information, leading to identification of opportunities for improvement — printed p.12, 8', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.4; 3.40, printed p.12, 8) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='b587b6e9-d389-42cf-a941-05d7b9e0701f' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-04 · water_sources — Aktuelle Wasserquellen
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='To develop the water use review, the organization shall: 1) analyse water use based on measurement and other data as follows: — identify current water sources; — identify current water-using activities and functions; — evaluate past and present water use; — estimate future water use. | — identify current water sources; — printed p.12', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.4 1), printed p.12) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='e2448d7c-6b06-4584-9a36-8d970759aa94' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-04 · significant_water_use — Signifikante Wassernutzung
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='2) identify, based on the water use analysis, the activities and functions of significant water use, including: — the facilities, equipment, systems, processes and personnel working for or on behalf of the organization that significantly affect water use; | — other relevant variables affecting water use; — the current performance of facilities, equipment and systems and processes related to identified significant water use. | 3.28 significant water use activity accounting for a substantial portion of total water used (3.39) [including any water consumed (3.31)] and/or offering considerable potential for water efficiency performance (3.37) improvement — printed p.12-13, 6', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.4 2); 3.28, printed p.12-13, 6) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='1f7852fc-70b1-4c39-8cac-8a26f363702e' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-04 · past_present_water_use — Vergangene und gegenwärtige Wassernutzung
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='To develop the water use review, the organization shall: 1) analyse water use based on measurement and other data as follows: — identify current water sources; — identify current water-using activities and functions; — evaluate past and present water use; — estimate future water use. | — evaluate past and present water use; — printed p.12', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.4 1), printed p.12) [VA — PDF text layer] — CAVEAT: the standard prints no unit for this datum; prod carries m3, the unit the standard itself uses throughout Annex B and Annex C (e.g. "50 000 m3/month")', verified_at=now() where id='671f0127-36b5-4aae-94ee-82bdc71749bf' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-04 · future_water_use_estimate — Geschätzte zukünftige Wassernutzung
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='To develop the water use review, the organization shall: 1) analyse water use based on measurement and other data as follows: — identify current water sources; — identify current water-using activities and functions; — evaluate past and present water use; — estimate future water use. | — estimate future water use. — printed p.12', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.4 1), printed p.12) [VA — PDF text layer] — CAVEAT: unit m3 is EKOWAI-chosen (see past_present_water_use); an estimate, hence correctly is_required=false', verified_at=now() where id='9540e682-a3b6-4de7-b419-2c01fe4aed9e' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-04 · business_activity_indicator — Geschäftsaktivitäts-Indikator
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall identify specific business activity indicator(s) appropriate for monitoring and measuring water efficiency performance. The methodology for determining and updating the business activity indicator(s) shall be retained as documented information, regularly reviewed and periodically updated as appropriate. Annex D gives examples of business activity indicator(s). | 3.4 business activity indicator measure of business activity (3.3) that takes into account core business operations specific to the application site | EXAMPLE Quantity of products produced, number of staff and visitors, number of guestrooms. — printed p.13, 2', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.5; 3.4, printed p.13, 2) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='631de3d8-15de-432b-bba9-953675dc2d50' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-04 · business_activity_indicator_value — Wert des Geschäftsaktivitäts-Indikators
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='Note 1 to entry: Depending on the business activity indicator, water use (3.39) (including any water consumed) will vary. For example, m3 of water/kg of product; l/person supplied; m3 of water/guestroom. | Table D.1 — Examples of business activity indicators — printed p.2, 37', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (3.4 Note 1; Annex D Table D.1, printed p.2, 37) [VA — PDF text layer] — CAVEAT: the standard requires IDENTIFYING the indicator (§6.2.5) and defines it (3.4); it never prints an obligation to record a numeric VALUE. This field is the engineer_input the water efficiency indicator (3.33) is computed per — supported by definition, not by a "shall". Its unit cannot be fixed: it follows the chosen indicator (units, persons, guestrooms — Annex D)', verified_at=now() where id='c6e3964a-1114-4614-b86e-bf87135186fa' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-04 · water_efficiency_indicator — Wassereffizienz-Indikator
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The methodology for determining and updating the water efficiency indicator(s) shall be maintained as documented information and regularly reviewed. Water efficiency indicator(s) shall be reviewed and compared with the baseline water efficiency indicator(s) as appropriate and periodically updated as appropriate. | 3.33 water efficiency indicator amount of water used per unit of business activity indicator (3.4) — printed p.13, 7', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.6; 3.33, printed p.13, 7) [VA — PDF text layer] — CAVEAT: unit is left "-" in prod because 3.33 makes it a ratio whose unit follows the business activity indicator ("m3 of water/kg of product; l/person supplied; m3 of water/guestroom" — 3.4 Note 1, printed p.2). Not a unit defect', verified_at=now() where id='15c44ca4-68b9-4f11-a466-ca7a011efa9b' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-04 · baseline_water_efficiency_indicator — Baseline-Wassereffizienz-Indikator
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall identify baseline water efficiency indicator(s) appropriate for monitoring and measuring its water efficiency programme achievements. Changes in water efficiency performance shall be measured against the baseline water efficiency indicator(s). Adjustments to the baseline(s) shall be made in the case of one or more of the following: a) the specific business activity indicator(s) no longer reflect organizational water use; b) there have been changes to the process, operational patterns or water systems; c) variation from predetermined and documented methods. | The organization shall retain documented information on its baseline water efficiency indicator(s). | 3.2 baseline water efficiency indicator reference level of water used per business activity indicator (3.4) — printed p.13, 2', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.7; 3.2, printed p.13, 2) [VA — PDF text layer] — CAVEAT: unit "-" for the same reason as water_efficiency_indicator (a ratio per business activity indicator)', verified_at=now() where id='890c8d57-2e2d-4776-9bf5-6a83d3ffa928' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-04 · baseline_adjustment_trigger — Baseline-Anpassungsauslöser
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall identify baseline water efficiency indicator(s) appropriate for monitoring and measuring its water efficiency programme achievements. Changes in water efficiency performance shall be measured against the baseline water efficiency indicator(s). Adjustments to the baseline(s) shall be made in the case of one or more of the following: a) the specific business activity indicator(s) no longer reflect organizational water use; b) there have been changes to the process, operational patterns or water systems; c) variation from predetermined and documented methods. — printed p.13', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.2.7 a)-c), printed p.13) [VA — PDF text layer] — the three enum values map 1:1 onto printed items a), b), c) — the enum domain is complete and contains no invented option', verified_at=now() where id='cfe6015e-62c7-47a0-87df-9c1992ddffab' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-04 · data_period — Datenzeitraum
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='A suitable data period should account for legal requirements or other requirements or variables that affect the organization’s water use. Variables may include weather, business activity cycles and other conditions. | 3.2 baseline water efficiency indicator reference level of water used per business activity indicator (3.4) — printed p.25, 2', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (A.7.5; 3.2 Note 2, printed p.25, 2) [VA — PDF text layer] — CAVEAT: A.7.5 is INFORMATIVE and modal ("A suitable data period should account for..."); 3.2 Note 2 is likewise a note. No "shall" anywhere prints a data period, so the field is correctly is_required=false and must never carry a block gate', verified_at=now() where id='07852034-d1ab-4999-9714-89b19da2b4cd' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');

-- ---------------- ISO-46001-05 — Zielwerte & Aktionsplaene ----------------
-- ISO-46001-05 · water_efficiency_target — Wassereffizienz-Zielwert
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall establish, within or supplemental to the objectives, water efficiency targets at relevant functions, levels, processes or facilities within the organization. Time frames shall be established for achievement of the targets. — printed p.13', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.3, printed p.13) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='cbda62dc-ceb3-4447-bf89-7b51d7683845' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-05 · target_time_frame — Zeitrahmen für Zielerreichung
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall establish, within or supplemental to the objectives, water efficiency targets at relevant functions, levels, processes or facilities within the organization. Time frames shall be established for achievement of the targets. — printed p.13', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.3, printed p.13) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='078e88ca-4731-4d27-872b-07e40fe1a73a' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-05 · action_plan — Aktionsplan
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall establish, implement and maintain action plans to achieve its targets on water use and water efficiency. The action plan shall include: 1) the designation of responsibility; 2) the means and time frame by which individual targets are to be achieved; 3) the method by which an improvement in water efficiency performance shall be verified; 4) the method of verifying the results. The action plans shall be maintained as documented information and updated at defined intervals. — printed p.14', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.3 1)-4), printed p.14) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='c5ced870-b353-46de-9e9c-d29002cf2434' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-05 · improvement_verification_method — Methode zur Verifizierung der Verbesserung
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall establish, implement and maintain action plans to achieve its targets on water use and water efficiency. The action plan shall include: 1) the designation of responsibility; 2) the means and time frame by which individual targets are to be achieved; 3) the method by which an improvement in water efficiency performance shall be verified; 4) the method of verifying the results. The action plans shall be maintained as documented information and updated at defined intervals. | 3) the method by which an improvement in water efficiency performance shall be verified; — printed p.14', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§6.3 3), printed p.14) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='688dbef1-0c15-4534-ac47-d467aeb314fa' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');

-- ---------------- ISO-46001-06 — Unterstuetzung: Ressourcen, Kompetenz, Kommunikation, Dokumentation ----------------
-- ISO-46001-06 · attest_iso_46001_06_cr_022 — Nachweis: 7.2
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall: a) determine the necessary competence of person(s) doing work under its control that affects its water efficiency performance; b) ensure that these persons are competent on the basis of appropriate education, training or experience; c) where applicable, take actions to acquire the necessary competence, and evaluate the effectiveness of the actions taken; d) retain appropriate documented information as evidence of competence. — printed p.14', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§7.2, printed p.14) [VA — PDF text layer] — attestation checkbox for gate CR-022 (clause 7.2)', verified_at=now() where id='fc5a79a8-442d-4f83-af7d-f16eae06a005' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-06 · attest_iso_46001_06_cr_024 — Nachweis: 7.4
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall determine the internal and external communications relevant to the water efficiency management system, including: a) on what it will communicate; b) when to communicate; c) with whom to communicate; d) how to communicate. The organization shall establish and implement a process by which any person working for, or on behalf of, the organization can make comments or suggest improvements to the water efficiency management system. — printed p.15', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§7.4, printed p.15) [VA — PDF text layer] — attestation checkbox for gate CR-024 (clause 7.4)', verified_at=now() where id='569776c2-2348-44b5-825b-8652417d68f9' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-06 · attest_iso_46001_06_cr_025 — Nachweis: 7.5.3
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='Documented information required by the water efficiency management system and by this document shall be controlled to ensure: a) it is available and suitable for use, where and when it is needed; b) it is adequately protected (e.g. from loss of confidentiality, improper use, loss of integrity). For the control of documented information, the organization shall address the following activities, as applicable: 1) distribution, access, retrieval and use; 2) storage and preservation, including preservation of legibility; 3) control of changes (e.g. version control); 4) retention and disposal. — printed p.16', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§7.5.3, printed p.16) [VA — PDF text layer] — attestation checkbox for gate CR-025 (clause 7.5.3)', verified_at=now() where id='95c56eb7-a994-421e-bdfd-94d555950bd6' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-06 · attest_iso_46001_06_cr_026 — Nachweis: 8.1
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall plan, implement and control the processes needed to meet requirements, and to implement the actions determined in 6.1, by: a) establishing criteria for the processes; b) implementing control of the processes in accordance with the criteria; c) keeping documented information to the extent necessary to have confidence that the processes have been carried out as planned. The organization shall control planned changes and review the consequences of unintended changes, taking action to mitigate any adverse effects, as necessary. The organization shall ensure that outsourced processes are controlled. — printed p.16', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§8.1, printed p.16) [VA — PDF text layer] — attestation checkbox for gate CR-026 (clause 8.1). MIS-HOMED: gate on ws-06, the §8.1 fields operational_planning_control/process_criteria are on ws-07 — staged', verified_at=now() where id='7b825ad8-8a47-4021-904e-3063f147928e' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-06 · attest_iso_46001_06_cr_028 — Nachweis: 8.3
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='When procuring water services, products and equipment that have, or may have, a significant impact on water use, the organization shall inform suppliers that procurement is partly evaluated on the basis of water efficiency performance. | The organization shall establish and implement the criteria for assessing water use and water efficiency over the planned or expected operating lifetime when procuring water services, products and equipment which are expected to have a significant impact on the organization’s water efficiency performance. The organization shall define and document water efficiency purchasing specifications, as applicable, for efficient water use. — printed p.17', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§8.3, printed p.17) [VA — PDF text layer] — attestation checkbox for gate CR-028 (clause 8.3). MIS-HOMED: gate on ws-06, the §8.3 fields are on ws-07 — staged. Also SCOPE-PREDICATE-FREE: the duty triggers only "When procuring ... that have, or may have, a significant impact on water use" — staged', verified_at=now() where id='8bb28714-c0a0-4286-9286-be209a632813' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-06 · resources_provided — Bereitgestellte Ressourcen
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall determine and provide the resources needed for the establishment, implementation, maintenance and continual improvement of the water efficiency management system. — printed p.14', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§7.1, printed p.14) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='0bdff531-b329-426d-9cf2-9fdbf8bb54be' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-06 · competence — Kompetenz
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall: a) determine the necessary competence of person(s) doing work under its control that affects its water efficiency performance; b) ensure that these persons are competent on the basis of appropriate education, training or experience; c) where applicable, take actions to acquire the necessary competence, and evaluate the effectiveness of the actions taken; d) retain appropriate documented information as evidence of competence. | 3.5 competence ability to apply knowledge and skills to achieve intended results — printed p.14, 2', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§7.2; 3.5, printed p.14, 2) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='67d0ce79-ed42-4ad5-87fc-292dd39c7993' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-06 · competence_evidence — Kompetenznachweis
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall: a) determine the necessary competence of person(s) doing work under its control that affects its water efficiency performance; b) ensure that these persons are competent on the basis of appropriate education, training or experience; c) where applicable, take actions to acquire the necessary competence, and evaluate the effectiveness of the actions taken; d) retain appropriate documented information as evidence of competence. | d) retain appropriate documented information as evidence of competence. — printed p.14', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§7.2 d), printed p.14) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='a3100734-df71-4eb9-92ca-27b5c750df78' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-06 · awareness — Bewusstsein
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='Persons doing work under the organization’s control shall be aware of: a) the water efficiency policy; | b) their roles, responsibilities and authorities in achieving the objectives of the water efficiency management system; c) their contribution to the effectiveness of the water efficiency management system, including the benefits of improved water efficiency performance; d) the impact, actual or potential, of their activities with respect to water use, and how their activities and behaviour contribute to the achievement of water efficiency management objectives and targets; e) the implications of not conforming with the water efficiency management system requirements. — printed p.14-15', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§7.3, printed p.14-15) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='bba6f31f-0bdb-4410-a4cc-43fc4f5392ac' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-06 · communication_plan — Kommunikationsplan
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall determine the internal and external communications relevant to the water efficiency management system, including: a) on what it will communicate; b) when to communicate; c) with whom to communicate; d) how to communicate. The organization shall establish and implement a process by which any person working for, or on behalf of, the organization can make comments or suggest improvements to the water efficiency management system. — printed p.15', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§7.4, printed p.15) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='027b1f43-7d2d-4485-8cc1-438c9f2b8448' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-06 · documented_information — Dokumentierte Information
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization’s water efficiency management system shall include: a) documented information required by this document; b) documented information determined by the organization as being necessary for the effectiveness of the water efficiency management system. | 3.9 documented information information required to be controlled and maintained by an organization (3.20) and the medium on which it is contained — printed p.15, 3', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§7.5.1; 3.9, printed p.15, 3) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='95fab97f-8fa0-4f77-b9fd-96a9e313330d' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-06 · doc_control — Lenkung dokumentierter Information
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='Documented information required by the water efficiency management system and by this document shall be controlled to ensure: a) it is available and suitable for use, where and when it is needed; b) it is adequately protected (e.g. from loss of confidentiality, improper use, loss of integrity). For the control of documented information, the organization shall address the following activities, as applicable: 1) distribution, access, retrieval and use; 2) storage and preservation, including preservation of legibility; 3) control of changes (e.g. version control); 4) retention and disposal. | Documented information of external origin determined by the organization to be necessary for the planning and operation of the water efficiency management system shall be identified, as appropriate, and controlled. — printed p.16', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§7.5.3, printed p.16) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='42bdd62a-57d4-4ca0-bebe-f71086aee9ff' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');

-- ---------------- ISO-46001-07 — Betrieb: Planung, Design, Beschaffung, Wartung ----------------
-- ISO-46001-07 · operational_planning_control — Betriebliche Planung und Steuerung
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall plan, implement and control the processes needed to meet requirements, and to implement the actions determined in 6.1, by: a) establishing criteria for the processes; b) implementing control of the processes in accordance with the criteria; c) keeping documented information to the extent necessary to have confidence that the processes have been carried out as planned. The organization shall control planned changes and review the consequences of unintended changes, taking action to mitigate any adverse effects, as necessary. The organization shall ensure that outsourced processes are controlled. — printed p.16', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§8.1, printed p.16) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='a8fa01ac-79bd-41a5-9375-7b23619f0dc3' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-07 · process_criteria — Prozesskriterien
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='Establishing criteria for processes includes setting minimum levels for the effective management of significant water use. Processes to be controlled include: 1) operation and maintenance activities which are related to the organization’s significant water use, discharges or pollution potential according to established operational criteria; 2) activities needed to meet requirements of the organization’s water efficiency policy, water efficiency objectives, targets and action plan. — printed p.16', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§8.1, printed p.16) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='aab258b6-ea83-4161-8c6e-4d8b42020151' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-07 · design_consideration — Design-Berücksichtigung der Wassereffizienz
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='When designing new, modified and renovated facilities, equipment, systems or processes that have a significant impact on its water efficiency performance, the organization shall consider, among other possibilities or options, the water efficiency performance improvement opportunities and operational control of the resulting design changes. The results of water efficiency performance evaluation shall be incorporated where appropriate into the specification, design and procurement activities of the relevant project(s). The considerations, results of the design activity, verification and any necessary action, as applicable, shall be documented. — printed p.17', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§8.2, printed p.17) [VA — PDF text layer] — CAVEAT: the duty is scope-conditional — "When designing new, modified and renovated facilities, equipment, systems or processes that have a significant impact on its water efficiency performance". Gate CR-027 blocks unconditionally with no "no such design activity" predicate — staged', verified_at=now() where id='563430c6-94e2-4c6b-af66-97c5fdb94269' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-07 · procurement_criteria — Beschaffungskriterien
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall establish and implement the criteria for assessing water use and water efficiency over the planned or expected operating lifetime when procuring water services, products and equipment which are expected to have a significant impact on the organization’s water efficiency performance. The organization shall define and document water efficiency purchasing specifications, as applicable, for efficient water use. — printed p.17', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§8.3, printed p.17) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='8d8dd97d-beb9-4085-ab29-bf990a54cc7e' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-07 · supplier_informed — Lieferanten informiert
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='When procuring water services, products and equipment that have, or may have, a significant impact on water use, the organization shall inform suppliers that procurement is partly evaluated on the basis of water efficiency performance. — printed p.17', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§8.3, printed p.17) [VA — PDF text layer] — CAVEAT: scope-conditional — "When procuring water services, products and equipment that have, or may have, a significant impact on water use"', verified_at=now() where id='c44ec866-9fef-40d3-9ed6-8e7ae172279d' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');
-- ISO-46001-07 · maintenance_inspection — Wartung und Inspektion
update public.fields set verification_status='verified_against_standard', verification_quote='The organization shall ensure that facilities, equipment, systems and processes that consume water are maintained and inspected on a regular basis to ensure water efficiency performance is consistently managed while taking operation requirements into consideration. — printed p.17', verification_note='md-verified 2026-09-05 (§8.4, printed p.17) [VA — PDF text layer]', verified_at=now() where id='c5f9533b-9fd4-4006-8a15-56d3a1f7de15' and verification_status not in ('verified_against_standard','corrected');

